    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.12",
    "summary": "Spend 2 CP during the opponent's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), in its [Fight step](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step), right after an enemy unit finishes its attacks, on a friendly unit **[eligible to fight](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step)**. Until the phase ends it has **[Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)**, and you must pick it as your next unit to fight.\n\nLike any Stratagem, it can be used only [once per phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
